<title>USA: MindSpring using U.S. Robotics hub.</title>
<headline>MindSpring using U.S. Robotics hub.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp said Tuesday that MindSpring Enterprises Inc, an Internet Service Provider, has installed the U.S. Robotics Total Control Enterprise Network Hub.</p>
<p>U.S. Robotics said MindSpring has also installed digital connections in preparation for U.S. Robotics new high-speed x2 technology. The technology allows for connection speeds to the Internet of up to 56 kilobits per second.</p>
<p>In addition, U.S. Robotics will include MindSpring's Internet connection software with its consumer modem products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
